        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.826,
            0.757,
            0.864
          ],
          "content": "You might be curious to look at the trends of a few other states. Are there other types of trends that states exhibit?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.868,
